{"schema":"learning-v2-theory.v1","lesson":22,"lang":"en","title":"Him, mine, yourself, the one","sections":[{"num":"01","title":"What you will learn to say","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"This lesson is about short words that replace people and things: him and her after an action, it for a thing, mine for «belongs to me», yourself, the … one, and another."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"give advice to a man","hi":"him"},{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"it belongs to me","hi":"mine"},{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"say who you are","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"the item with a hood","hi":"one"},{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"a different way to pay","hi":"another"}]}]},{"num":"02","title":"him, her, them — after the action","defaultOpen":true,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"When a person comes after the action, he, she, they change to him, her, them: I can advise him. Me and you can also come after the action: I do not want to disappoint you."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"action","accent":true},{"text":"me / you / him / her / us / them","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I can advise him.","translation":"give him advice","hi":"him"},{"en":"I want to congratulate her.","translation":"say well done to her","hi":"her"},{"en":"I admire them.","translation":"I think they are great","hi":"them"},{"en":"I do not want to disappoint you.","translation":"I do not want you to feel let down","hi":"you"},{"en":"This story can amuse them.","translation":"make them laugh","hi":"them"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can advise he.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"I can advise his.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"I want to congratulate she.","right":"I want to congratulate her."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"choice","kind":"choice","before":"I want to support","after":".","options":["her","she","hers"],"answer":"her","why":"After the action, a woman is her."}}]},{"num":"03","title":"it and them — for things","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"After the action, one thing is it and several things are them: Could I unscrew it? Could I untangle them? Not its, not they."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"action","accent":true},{"text":"it (one thing) / them (several)","accent":false}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I unscrew it?","translation":"take the screw out","hi":"it"},{"en":"Could I untangle them?","translation":"separate the knotted things","hi":"them"},{"en":"Could I strain it?","translation":"remove the water","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can calculate it.","translation":"work out the number","hi":"it"},{"en":"I can round it down.","translation":"make the number lower","hi":"it"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"Could I untangle they?","right":"Could I untangle them?"},{"wrong":"Could I unscrew its?","right":"Could I unscrew it?"}]}]},{"num":"04","title":"mine, yours, ours — with no thing after","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"When the thing is already named and you say who it belongs to, use mine, yours, his, hers, ours: This phone case is mine. my always needs a thing after it."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"this","accent":true},{"text":"is","accent":true},{"text":"mine / yours / his / hers / ours","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"This phone case is mine.","translation":"it belongs to me","hi":"mine"},{"en":"This travel mug is yours.","translation":"it belongs to you","hi":"yours"},{"en":"This rain jacket is ours.","translation":"it belongs to us","hi":"ours"},{"en":"This yoga mat is hers.","translation":"it belongs to her","hi":"hers"},{"en":"This electric razor is his.","translation":"it belongs to him","hi":"his"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"This phone case is me.","right":"This phone case is mine."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"binary","kind":"binary","question":"You point at your friend's mat. How do you say it belongs to her?","optionA":"This yoga mat is her.","optionB":"This yoga mat is hers.","correct":"B","explain":"Belonging to her, with no thing after: hers."}}]},{"num":"05","title":"yourself — the same person","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"When the action goes back to the same person, use yourself: You can introduce yourself. Just you is wrong here."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"you","accent":true},{"text":"action","accent":true},{"text":"yourself","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"You can introduce yourself.","translation":"say your own name","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You need to look after yourself.","translation":"take care of your own health","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You should not blame yourself.","translation":"it is not your fault","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can be yourself.","translation":"act naturally","hi":"yourself"},{"en":"You can forgive yourself.","translation":"stop feeling bad","hi":"yourself"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"You need to look after you.","right":"You need to look after yourself."}]}]},{"num":"06","title":"one and ones — not repeating the thing","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"To avoid naming the thing again, say the + describing word + one (one thing) or ones (several): I want the hooded one. it does not work here."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"the","accent":true},{"text":"describing word","accent":true},{"text":"one / ones","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want the hooded one.","translation":"the jacket with a hood","hi":"one"},{"en":"I like the patterned ones.","translation":"the ones with a pattern","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I prefer the padded one.","translation":"the soft, thick one","hi":"one"},{"en":"I want the slip-on ones.","translation":"shoes with no laces","hi":"ones"},{"en":"I want the ready-to-eat one.","translation":"you can eat it now","hi":"one"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I want the hooded it.","right":"I want the hooded one."}]},{"kind":"drill","drill":{"type":"word_bank","kind":"word_bank","prompt":"Say that you like the ones with a pattern.","answer":["I","like","the","patterned","ones"],"distractors":["one","it"]}}]},{"num":"07","title":"another — one more, a different one","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"When you need one new option instead of this one: another + one thing. I need another payment method. Do not use other alone with one thing."},{"kind":"formula","formula":[{"text":"another","accent":true},{"text":"one thing","accent":true}]},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I need another payment method.","translation":"a different way to pay","hi":"another"},{"en":"I need another meeting place.","translation":"a different place to meet","hi":"another"},{"en":"We use another departure gate.","translation":"a different gate","hi":"another"},{"en":"I want another room type.","translation":"a different kind of room","hi":"another"}]},{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."},{"wrong":"I need others payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]}]},{"num":"08","title":"Review: Could I…? and to — the reason","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"From earlier lessons: Could I…? asks politely; to + action gives the reason. Could I book a table? I use an umbrella to stay dry."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"Could I book a table?","translation":"a polite request","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"Could I get some fresh air?","translation":"go outside for a moment","hi":"Could I"},{"en":"I use an umbrella to stay dry.","translation":"the reason","hi":"to stay"},{"en":"I fill the kettle to boil the water.","translation":"the reason","hi":"to boil"}]}]},{"num":"09","title":"Mistakes almost everyone makes","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"fix","fixes":[{"wrong":"I can advise he.","right":"I can advise him."},{"wrong":"Could I untangle they?","right":"Could I untangle them?"},{"wrong":"This phone case is my.","right":"This phone case is mine."},{"wrong":"You can introduce you.","right":"You can introduce yourself."},{"wrong":"I need other payment method.","right":"I need another payment method."}]},{"kind":"tip","text":"After the action — him, her, them, it. Belongs to me, no thing after — mine. The same person — yourself. Do not repeat the thing — one or ones. A different one — another."}]},{"num":"10","title":"What to take into practice","defaultOpen":false,"blocks":[{"kind":"body","text":"Person after the action — him / her / them. Thing — it / them. No thing after — mine, yours, ours. Same person — yourself. The … one. A different one — another."},{"kind":"examples","examples":[{"en":"I want to praise him.","translation":"say good things about him","hi":"him"},{"en":"This overnight bag is yours.","translation":"it belongs to you","hi":"yours"},{"en":"You can think for yourself.","translation":"decide on your own","hi":"yourself"}]}]}],"sessionSection":{"1":"02","2":"02","3":"02","4":"02","5":"03","6":"03","7":"03","8":"03","9":"04","10":"04","11":"04","12":"04","13":"08","14":"08","15":"08","16":"08","17":"05","18":"05","19":"05","20":"05","21":"08","22":"08","23":"08","24":"08","25":"06","26":"06","27":"06","28":"06","29":"06","30":"08","31":"08","32":"08","33":"07","34":"07","35":"07","36":"07","37":"07","38":"08","39":"08","40":"08","41":"08","42":"08","43":"08","44":"08","45":"08","46":"08","47":"08","48":"08","49":"08","50":"08","51":"08","52":"08","53":"08","54":"08"}}
